  "prompts": [
    "Build a US fanbase reactivation journey across the 2026 NFL season.",
    "Reactivate inactive US fans across the 2026 NFL season using calendar-driven touchpoints. All-fans emails at preseason kickoff, Week 0, Thanksgiving, and Super Bowl. For fans with a favorite team, route to one additional rivalry/divisional week touch based on fav-team mapping.",
    "Need a season-long reactivation backbone \u2014 major league moments for all inactive fans, plus a per-fav-team rivalry-week routing layer."
  ],
